                    absolution
                    retribution
                    doubt
        XXI     THE WORLD:
                    completion
                    abundance
                    delay


freedom ->      fool        | sun                   | hanged man    | 
power ->        magician    | chariot               | strength      | 
wisdom ->       priestess   | hierophant            | hermit        | temperance
abundance ->    empress     | wheel of fortune      | the world     |
retribution ->  justice     | judgment              | emperor       |
renewal ->      death       | star                  | tower         |

fool  -> freedom
hierophant -> wisdom
strength -> power
wheel of fortune -> abundance
justice -> retribution
death -> renewal
devil -> emotion